# NovaCore

A modern, lightweight, and scalable foundation for building efficient software solutions.

## 🚀 Features

* Clean and modular architecture
* Easy to extend and maintain
* High performance and optimized design
* Well-documented source code
* Beginner-friendly structure
* Production-ready foundation

## 📦 Installation

```bash
git clone https://github.com/your-username/NovaCore.git
cd NovaCore
```

## ⚡ Getting Started

Follow the project documentation to install dependencies and start development.

```bash
# Install dependencies
npm install

# Run the project
npm start
```

*(Replace the commands above with the appropriate ones for your programming language or framework.)*

